      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 288,
        "content": "### 1) Cookie & Search Term Selection  \n**What it does**  \n\u2022 Downloads cookie list \u279c **Select Cookie** picks one based on time slice.  \n\u2022 **Generate Random Search Term** (GPT-4o) outputs a keyword.\n\n**Credentials**  \nOpenAI + SharePoint OAuth2.\n\n**Tweaks**  \n\u2022 Edit the prompt for another industry.  \n\u2022 Add/remove cookies in SharePoint file."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "484f3995-1e11-461b-92a7-2c55e49d1ed5",
      "name": "Sticky Note6",
