        -1360
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 512,
        "height": 256,
        "content": "### 2) Scrape LinkedIn Posts  \n**What it does**  \n\u2022 **Phantombuster LinkedIn Search Agent** fetches posts for the keyword.  \n\u2022 **Get Posts** gathers raw results for the next branch.\n\n**Credentials**  \nPhantombuster API.\n\n**Tweaks**  \n\u2022 Increase `ENV_SEARCH_RESULTS_PER_LAUNCH`.  \n\u2022 Adjust search filters inside the agent\u2019s Phantombuster UI."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "5642f703-bbc7-4869-bad3-7684c735eb34",
      "name": "Sticky Note7",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -2544,
        -608
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 512,
        "height": 272,
        "content": "### 3) CSV Upload & Auto-like  \n**What it does**  \n\u2022 **Get Random Post** picks one post and appends company-ID.  \n\u2022 Builds one-row CSV \u279c uploads to SharePoint.  \n\u2022 **Autolike Agent** receives the CSV link and likes the post.\n\n**Credentials**  \nSharePoint OAuth2 + Phantombuster API.\n\n**Tweaks**  \n\u2022 Change company ID in **Set ENV Variables** if using a LinkedIn-Page.  \n\u2022 Modify filename/folder in **Upload CSV** or use another storage service."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "afc3d92b-aff2-4fbe-b266-0f2b9eecad42",
      "name": "Sticky Note8",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -1152,
        -608
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 448,
        "height": 288,
        "content": "### 4) Deduplication  \n**What it does**  \n\u2022 Downloads `linkedin_posts_already_liked.csv`.  \n\u2022 **Check if in List** prevents liking the same URL twice.  \n\u2022 On success, appends the new URL and re-uploads the file.\n\n**Credentials**  \nSharePoint OAuth2.\n\n**Tweaks**  \n\u2022 Alter duplicate logic in the Code node if you store extra columns.  \n\u2022 Switch to Google Sheets for easier manual review."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
