        "height": 272,
        "content": "### 5) Rate Limiting & Scheduling  \n**What it does**  \n\u2022 Hourly cron + **Wait** nodes keep totals near 400 likes/day (20 launches \u00d7 20 posts).\n\n**Credentials**  \nNone\n\n**Tweaks**  \n\u2022 Edit cron time or wait durations to match your plan limits.  \n\u2022 Increase likes/day by raising limits in both Wait nodes and Phantombuster arguments."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
